{"id": "5c237d46-ffc1-4855-977c-cf7cf3c29188", "slug": "sylvan-testimonials", "title": "Sylvan Testimonials", "description": "Sylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Sylvan Testimonials\"\ndescription: \"Sylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#1B2B22\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#EEF1EA\"\n  surface: \"#1B2B22\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#1B2B22\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"23px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Sylvan Testimonials\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 10; favorites: 2; remixes: 2.\nTags: testimonial, section, social-proof, animated.\n## Overview\nSylvan Testimonials UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\n[ Deployment Feedback ] Trusted by Wilderness Pioneers. 01 Elara Vance Director of Ecology \"The Sylvan interface completely revolutionized our data collection in deep forest sectors. It's incredibly intuitive, and the l…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Trusted by Wilderness Pioneers.; Elara Vance; Dr. Kaelen Aris; Jonah R. Fielding; Join the pioneers reshaping wilderness conservation..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #1B2B22, accent #10B981, background #EEF1EA, surface #1B2B22, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Sylvan Testimonials</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#eef1ea] font-sans text-base antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-16 px-4 md:px-8 relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#10b981] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Decorative Container Lines & Squares (Skill Directive) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-evenly opacity-10\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-12 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-[#1b2b22] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[2px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-[#1b2b22] bg-[#eef1ea]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full flex flex-col gap-8 lg:gap-10 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Section Header -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center mt-8 md:mt-0\">\n             <div class=\"text-[#3e5e4a] font-mono text-xs mb-3 tracking-widest uppercase\">[ Deployment Feedback ]</div>\n             <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#1b2b22]\">Trusted by Wilderness Pioneers.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Grid Layout -->\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:gap-6 h-full\">\n\n                <!-- Testimonial 01: Light Variant with Gradient Border -->\n                <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/40 to-[#c8d4c0] shadow-sm transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-md min-h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] group\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#e6ebd6] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#7d8c76] tracking-wider\">01</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:quote-left-linear\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"text-[#c8d4c0] absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-40 transform -rotate-12 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 relative z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1b2b22]/40 to-transparent flex-shrink-0\">\n                                <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=32\" alt=\"Avatar\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[#2f4035] font-semibold text-sm\">Elara Vance</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-[#7d8c76] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mt-0.5\">Director of Ecology</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-[#4a6b57] text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed relative z-10 flex-grow font-medium\">\n                            \"The Sylvan interface completely revolutionized our data collection in deep forest sectors. It's incredibly intuitive, and the localized network stability guarantees our telemetry never drops.\"\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Testimonial 02: Dark Variant with Sharp WebGL-style Animation -->\n                <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#10b981]/30 via-transparent to-transparent min-h-[350px] lg:h-full group transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)]\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0b120e] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-6 lg:p-8 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#3e5e4a] tracking-wider z-20\">02</span>\n\n                        <!-- Canvas Animation Container -->\n                        <canvas id=\"spatial-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-60 mix-blend-screen transition-opacity duration-700 group-hover:opacity-100 z-0\"></canvas>\n\n                        <!-- Gradients Overlay -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0b120e] via-[#0b120e]/80 to-[#0b120e]/40 z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#34d399] to-transparent flex-shrink-0\">\n                                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=11\" alt=\"Avatar\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-[#eef1ea] font-semibold text-sm\">Dr. Kaelen Aris</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[#34d399] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mt-0.5\">Lead Field Researcher</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-auto transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-[-4px]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:quote-left-linear\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"text-[#34d399] mb-3 opacity-80\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <p class=\"text-[#9ca3af] text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                                    \"Integrating their packets into our existing mesh networks was seamless. Canopy Sense provides a level of clarity we didn't think was possible in totally disconnected wild spaces.\"\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column (Testimonial 03 / Featured) -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-bl from-[#34d399]/15 via-transparent to-[#10b981]/5 h-full group transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(11,18,14,0.4)] min-h-[500px]\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0f1712] rounded-[23px] w-full h-full p-6 md:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <span class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#3e5e4a] tracking-wider\">03</span>\n\n                    <!-- Nested Inner Card with Gradient Border -->\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent rounded-2xl mb-12 relative overflow-hidden flex-grow\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#152019] rounded-[15px] p-6 md:p-8 w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                                <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#34d399] to-transparent flex-shrink-0\">\n                                    <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47\" alt=\"Avatar\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base\">Jonah R. Fielding</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[#8e9c92] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mt-1\">Chief Operations</p>\n                                    <div class=\"flex gap-0.5 mt-2 text-[#34d399]\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" width=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <p class=\"text-[#8e9c92] text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-md italic font-medium\">\n                                \"A masterclass in decentralized stability. The way Sylvan processes bio-metric scanning while maintaining network integrity in the harshest environments is nothing short of miraculous. It has become the central nervous system of our entire operation.\"\n                            </p>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-center text-[#4a6b57] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:verified-check-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon> Verified Deployment</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Action Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto z-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-8 leading-tight\">\n                            Join the pioneers <br> reshaping wilderness <br> conservation.\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#10b981] hover:bg-[#34d399] text-[#042f2e] font-semibold text-sm py-4 px-6 rounded-xl w-full flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-300 transform active:scale-[0.98] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(52,211,153,0.3)] group/btn\">\n                            <span>Read the full case studies</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Script (Sharp WebGL Lines Style) -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('spatial-canvas');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let nodes = [];\n\n            function resize() {\n                width = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            class Node {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                    this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.6;\n                }\n                update() {\n                    this.x += this.vx;\n                    this.y += this.vy;\n                    if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                    if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n                }\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.5)';\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                    ctx.strokeRect(this.x - 1, this.y - 1, 2, 2);\n                }\n            }\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++) nodes.push(new Node());\n\n            let angle = 0;\n\n            function animate() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n                angle += 0.003;\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {\n                    nodes[i].update();\n                    nodes[i].draw();\n\n                    for (let j = i + 1; j < nodes.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = nodes[i].x - nodes[j].x;\n                        const dy = nodes[i].y - nodes[j].y;\n                        const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (distance < 70) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(16, 185, 129, ${0.2 - distance/350})`;\n                            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                            ctx.moveTo(nodes[i].x, nodes[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(nodes[j].x, nodes[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Draw rotating sharp central geometry\n                const cx = width / 2;\n                const cy = height / 3;\n                const size = 40;\n\n                const points = [\n                    {x: 0, y: -size, z: 0},\n                    {x: size, y: 0, z: size},\n                    {x: 0, y: 0, z: -size},\n                    {x: -size, y: 0, z: size},\n                    {x: 0, y: size, z: 0}\n                ];\n\n                const projected = points.map(p => {\n                    const cosA = Math.cos(angle);\n                    const sinA = Math.sin(angle);\n                    const rx = p.x * cosA - p.z * sinA;\n                    const rz = p.x * sinA + p.z * cosA;\n                    const scale = 200 / (200 + rz);\n                    return { x: cx + rx * scale, y: cy + p.y * scale };\n                });\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1)';\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[0].x, projected[0].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[1].x, projected[1].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[4].x, projected[4].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[3].x, projected[3].y);\n                ctx.closePath(); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[0].x, projected[0].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[2].x, projected[2].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[4].x, projected[4].y); ctx.stroke();\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(projected[1].x, projected[1].y); ctx.lineTo(projected[2].x, projected[2].y);\n                ctx.lineTo(projected[3].x, projected[3].y); ctx.stroke();\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "sylvan-testimonials.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/sylvan-testimonials.jpg", "source_name": "sylvan-testimonials-DESIGN.md", "views": 97, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T12:47:04.617528+00:00"}